      "analysis_html": "<div class=\"math-tex math-block\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}1-\\alpha&amp;=0.9,\\alpha=0.1,\\text{由}\\Phi(u_{\\alpha2})=1-\\frac{\\alpha}{2}=0.95,\\text{查表，得}\\\\&amp;\\quad\\quad\\quad u_{\\alpha2}=1.645,\\\\ \\text{再由}n_1=15,n_2=20,\\text{得}\\\\&amp;\\quad\\sqrt{\\frac{\\sigma_1^2}{n_1}+\\frac{\\sigma_2^2}{n_2}}=\\sqrt{\\frac{16+9}{15+20}}=\\sqrt{\\frac{91}{60}}\\approx1.232,\\\\&amp;u_{\\alpha2}\\sqrt{\\frac{\\sigma_1^2}{n_1}+\\frac{\\sigma_2^2}{n_2}}=1.645\\times1.232\\approx2.03,\\\\&amp;\\quad\\frac{\\overline{x}}{\\overline{x}_1-\\overline{x}_2}=14.6-13.2=1.4,\\\\ \\text{所以，}\\mu_1-\\mu_2\\text{的}90\\%\\text{的置信区间为}\\\\&amp;\\quad(1.4-2.03,1.4+2.03)=(-0.63,3.43).\\end{aligned}\">\\begin{aligned}1-\\alpha&amp;=0.9,\\alpha=0.1,\\text{由}\\Phi(u_{\\alpha2})=1-\\frac{\\alpha}{2}=0.95,\\text{查表，得}\\\\&amp;\\quad\\quad\\quad u_{\\alpha2}=1.645,\\\\ \\text{再由}n_1=15,n_2=20,\\text{得}\\\\&amp;\\quad\\sqrt{\\frac{\\sigma_1^2}{n_1}+\\frac{\\sigma_2^2}{n_2}}=\\sqrt{\\frac{16+9}{15+20}}=\\sqrt{\\frac{91}{60}}\\approx1.232,\\\\&amp;u_{\\alpha2}\\sqrt{\\frac{\\sigma_1^2}{n_1}+\\frac{\\sigma_2^2}{n_2}}=1.645\\times1.232\\approx2.03,\\\\&amp;\\quad\\frac{\\overline{x}}{\\overline{x}_1-\\overline{x}_2}=14.6-13.2=1.4,\\\\ \\text{所以，}\\mu_1-\\mu_2\\text{的}90\\%\\text{的置信区间为}\\\\&amp;\\quad(1.4-2.03,1.4+2.03)=(-0.63,3.43).\\end{aligned}</div>"
